<title>PHILIPPINES: Mabuhay 9-mth net loss 62.502 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Mabuhay 9-mth net loss 62.502 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mabuhay Holdings Corp said on Thursday it had posted a net loss of 62.502 million pesos in the first nine months of the year.  </p>
<p>The firm said in a report to the Philippine Stock Exchange its revenues from January to September reached 47.711 million pesos.</p>
<p>It did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>Mabuhay has interests in real estate development, power generation, and hotel management.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-6267</p>
